* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB3 VB2 VB4 IBUF VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net0 1p
M10 EAO VB2 net6 VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M11 net3 VB3 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M12 net6 VB3 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M13 net5 VB4 VDD VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
